==English==
===Alternative spellings===
*'''monolog''' (''US'')

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A long speech by one person; a [[soliloquy]].
# ''(comedy)'' Such a speech made by a [[comedian]], with intended [[humor]]ous effect.
# A talk with little contribution from another person.

===Verb===

# To perform a monologue.
# To talk with little contribution from another person.

===Entomology===

[[Mono-]] one, ''logos'' word.

